      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THUMANI (2) is a consistent type who is lining up for his first start here. Last start winner off the rails draw scoring by one length at Mandurah over 488m (27.51). Solid formlines coming through his last run. Makes plenty of appeal if runs up to latest. HARD TO FORGET (1) filled a minor placing last start at this track behind Chama (34.97) in a Grade 4/5. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Has a very good strike-rate from this draw, with two wins from three starts. Can measure up. HURRY UP ERIC (4) goes very well this trip starting 20 times for eight wins and seven minors. In the money last time at Mandurah (28.06) in a Free For All, finishing a 2.5 lengths third. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. SWEET BEE (5) returns after a break and looks a top-three hope.",
